        reason: >-
          Not applicable. The affected code is in esbuild's Deno module, which
          the npm package does not ship. The matching GitHub advisory
          (GHSA-gv7w-rqvm-qjhr) has been withdrawn.
        expires: 2027-01-16T00:00:00.000Z
        created: 2026-10-18T00:00:00.000Z
